  "primary_comparison": "At fixed 20 um grid, halve only diffusion/source/reservoir integration step from 0.01 to 0.005 min. Mechanics and phenotype steps and biological inputs are unchanged.",
  "secondary_comparison": "Joint grid and diffusion-step change relative to the original 40 um representation; this comparison does not isolate one numerical setting.",
